// Companion to p24_import_vibex.vibe, and a probe in its own right
// (#2229, ADR-0075): an executable root carrying an `export fn`. Round 2
// measured this ACCEPTED (it checked, built and ran) while the ADR says
// a .vibex has no export surface -- nothing can import one, so the
// export was unreachable by construction. #2229's fix enforces the ADR:
// the compile lane and the check directive both answer
//   .vibex is an executable root and has no export surface; move
//   'export fn helper' to a .vibe module and import it from main
// (exit 1). The import-side rejection this file partners in
// (p24_import_vibex.vibe) is unchanged.
//! cli: check
export fn helper() -> Int { 7 }
fn main with Console {
  println("dep")
}
